                        target="frus1951v07p1#pg_439">p. 439</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d322-f2" n="2" xml:id="d322-f2-content">
                <p>The September 5 memorandum transmitted the memorandum by Secretary Marshall to
                    Mr. Lay, September 4, <ref target="frus1951v07p1#pg_881">p. 881</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d322-f3" n="3" xml:id="d322-f3-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d322-f4" n="4" xml:id="d322-f4-content">
                <p>
                    NSC Action No. 561 indicated that at its 103d
                    meeting, September 26, the Council took note of this progress report (S/S Files: Lot 62 D 1: NSC Actions).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
